    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "已知 \\(f(x^2+1)=x^4-1\\)，则函数 \\(f(x)\\) 的解析式为（　）　A. \\(f(x)=x^2-2x\\)　B. \\(f(x)=x^2-1\\)（\\(x≥1\\)）　C. \\(f(x)=x^2-2x+2\\)（\\(x≥1\\)）　D. \\(f(x)=x^2-2x\\)（\\(x≥1\\)）",
        "answerId": "answerI",
        "answer": "D"
      }
    ]
  },
